     "body": "<p>I agree with <a href=\"https://fedora-repository.atlassian.net/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?accountId=557058%3A24c578cc-15e9-4649-9f68-5eace85735e0\" class=\"user-hover\" rel=\"557058:24c578cc-15e9-4649-9f68-5eace85735e0\" data-account-id=\"557058:24c578cc-15e9-4649-9f68-5eace85735e0\" accountid=\"557058:24c578cc-15e9-4649-9f68-5eace85735e0\" rel=\"noreferrer\">A. Soroka</a> — this PR is an improvement, but we may be handling too many different things with that exception.  For example, the precondition failure is a good example of normal behavior that probably shouldn't even be a warning.</p>",
     "created": "18/Jan/17 11:41 AM",
