  "description": "<p>WebApplicationException logging should be reduced from 'error' to 'warn'.</p>\n\n<p>A notable example of where a WebApplicationException is not an 'error' is in precondition-evaluation:<br/>\n<a href=\"https://github.com/fcrepo4/fcrepo4/blob/master/fcrepo-http-api/src/main/java/org/fcrepo/http/api/ContentExposingResource.java#L589\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">https://github.com/fcrepo4/fcrepo4/blob/master/fcrepo-http-api/src/main/java/org/fcrepo/http/api/ContentExposingResource.java#L589</a></p>",
